
cff-version: 1.2.0
title: optuml
message: >-
  OptuML (for Optuna and ML) is a Python module that
  provides hyperparameter optimization for several machine
  learning algorithms using the Optuna framework. The module
  supports a variety of algorithms and allows easy
  hyperparameter tuning through a scikit-learn-like API.
type: software
